  27:../src/misc.c **** /**
  28:../src/misc.c ****  * @fn void vApplicationMallocFailedHook()
  29:../src/misc.c ****  * @brief Handler in case malloc fails.
  30:../src/misc.c ****  * Currently, FreeRTOS is using the heap1 model, in which only malloc() is implemented,
  31:../src/misc.c ****  * not free(). Dynamic allocation is used only during initialization, not during operation.
  32:../src/misc.c ****  * Initialization failures are handled by configASSERT()s so this may not be necessary.
  33:../src/misc.c ****  *
  34:../src/misc.c ****  */
